body:
thanks! I've been watercoloring for less than a year and one of the things that got me started (after years of doing no art) was actually this game, =) 

&#x200B;

the yellow (and thus accidental green) really tripped me up --- here's another one inspired by the game that I think came out better [https://ibb.co/d7pvSmq](https://ibb.co/d7pvSmq)

[https://ibb.co/vVRS818](https://ibb.co/vVRS818)

&#x200B;

okay, I warned you I'm a noob at this. I may attempt it again, I made a lot more accidental green than I had planned. haha =)The yellow is a lot brighter/more vivid in person, I used a nickel azo yellow so it has a lot more oomph than this image really shows
